<h1>custom dice</h1>
<p>You can buy a bag of blank dice for very cheap on Amazon.
I use a wet erase marker to test out custom markings.</p>
<p>Once I'm happy with it, I'll go over the marker with an engraving pen / dremel to make a groove.
You can fill the groove with craft paint and wipe the die face over a sheet of paper on a flat surface to get a crisp edge.</p>
<h1>ai image generation</h1>
<p>I use <a href="https://github.com/Acly/krita-ai-diffusion">krita ai diffusion</a> to create quick environmental backdrops and character art.</p>
<ol>
<li><p>generate image from base prompt at 100% strength</p>
</li>
<li><p>lightly edit AI glitches. Don't worry about fine details, just get the large shapes and color blocks right.</p>
</li>
<li><p>regenerate image with the same prompt at ~80% strength</p>
</li>
<li><p>chuck all the images in a google slides presentation</p>
</li>
<li><p>give a title to each slide so that they can be jumped to easily from the presenter view</p>
</li>
<li><p>you can use presenter notes for room descriptions, etc. They can't be edited live though. I use a physical notebook instead.</p>
</li>
</ol>
